[center][size=6][color=#93c47d][b]Eve (Stellar Blade) v1.5.0[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[b]Added[/b]
[list]
[*]Peony joins the six existing Eve outfits, with body-fitting clothing and CSS body-shape controls.
[*]Four palette templates: Black and white floral (default), CNS original, Hydrangea recolor and Peony recolor.
[*]Optional glowing, flowing trim with adjustable glow and flow speed.
[*]Removable clothing pieces and support for customized Genessa doubles on Peony.
[*]Facial-expression controls and synchronized facial playback for supported animations across all seven Eve outfits.
[*]52 additional idle animations through CSS Shared Assets.
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ngodn/CustomShellSystem/e06a567a9201fc688203fef2ceddf3412957c217/docs/media/v1.0.0/eve-peony.jpg[/img]

[b]Fixes and improvements[/b]
[list]
[*]Reduced excessive Eve chest and glute motion with corrected motion limits.
[*]Restored the selected motion settings after changing outfits or entering and leaving customization.
[/list]

[b]Updating[/b]
Close the game. Install CSS v1.0.1 and its matching CSS Shared Assets download, then replace CSS_EveStellarBlade_eins0fx_P with the folder from this ZIP. Keep each package's three files together. Keep your CSS settings and saved profiles.

Small clipping in some poses or at extreme body settings may remain. Slipstream is not included.

Peony/Hydrangea source: [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stellarblade/mods/1724]Peony/Hydrangea V2 CNS and recolor pack[/url]. CSS adaptation and integration by eins0fx.
